{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/7283872/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前同じblogを更新してしまってた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/7283872/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっちまったな〜Sorry\nあっ洗濯機の原因わかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/7283872/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"洗濯機の蛇口をひねってなくて、水を出さずに洗濯してたの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/7283872/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"洗濯ってよりも、ただ洗濯機の中で服が回ってただけかぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/7283872/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから汚れも落ちなくてクリーニング屋さんに行ってたの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/7283872/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"洗剤をかけたとこが染みになってたみたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/7283872/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オーマイガー\nてことで、悩み解決しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/7283872/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お騒がせしてSorry"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/7283872/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/7283872/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qベット何インチくらい？\nAわかんない〜(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qレッスン着ってどんなの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aバットマンの服"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/7283872/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qちゃんと除菌してる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aまだ買ったばかりでやったことない(涙)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q二回も同じブログ更新？\nA間違えた(笑)ごめんちゃい(涙)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q写メのベットてまじ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aまじだぁ〜(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q海外旅行みやげってわたせるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aハイ！多分(笑)食べ物でなければ！えっ？海外？海外いくの〜凄い！いいなぁ(笑)まぁやも行く〜(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q名古屋ライブ大変だったんじゃない？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A楽しすぎて逆に大変だったかも(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q風邪とか大丈夫？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A私は風邪ひかないのじゃっ(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q料理出来る男性はどう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aカッコイイ！出来るの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qやはりまあや姫？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aそんな×２"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q一期一会という言葉は好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A好き！大好きですっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q心霊写真撮ったとか体験したことある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A見間違えならありますぅ！木が人に見えたりなど...(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"QメンバーでEXILE好きな人いる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aどうだろ？わかんない聞いたことないなぁ！Sorry"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q勉強道具はちゃんとある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aありますよ〜(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q召し使いはいるのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aそんなのお嬢様じゃあるまいしいないよぉ(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q今度名前言うから覚えてくれる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aありがと！オッケー覚える(照)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qバスケは好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A好き！バスケしてよく遊んでた！よく突き指したぁ(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q説明書見てみたら？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A壊れたかと思って最初は何回もみたいよ〜(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q個別行ったらあだ名覚えてくれる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aイエス☆よろしく♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q洗剤いれるとこがあるんじゃない？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A柔軟剤ならあったのだぁ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qマキガミまあや好き！と言ったものです！覚えてますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aあのときは嬉しかったぁ♪ありがとう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qめっちゃループするから嫌がらないでね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A嫌がるわけないじゃん(`ヘ´)喜ぶし(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q洗濯機がよごれているのでは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aこの前買ったからピッカピカなんだよん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q質問返しも沢山文字打つから疲れるでしょ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A疲れない♪お手紙交換してるみたいで楽しい(笑)いつもニヤニヤしてるよ(笑)\nQ何か白い服と一緒に洗っているのでは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A白い服と洗ってたかな？でも大丈夫だったの大丈夫です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qうさぎちゃんたちも元気かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A覚えてくださったのですねぇ♪このとうりっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/7283872/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qまあやたんの部屋は春の花が飾られているのでは？\nA花飾りたくて今日花屋さん行ったんだぁ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qなんで体操服なの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A撮影だったからなのだっ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qちゃんとネットに入れて洗ってる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A洗ってるよ☆キラーン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qおじさんにあうサイズ売ってるかな？水着もある？\nA何でもあるよ♪行ってみなぁ(笑)まあやに会ったら声かけてね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qスーツでngng会、参戦しても大丈夫？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aいいよぉ♪きてくれるなら(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qまあやの好きな男性のファッションは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A特にないなぁ(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q乃木メンで逃走中出るとしたら逃げ切れる自信ある？それとも自首する？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A逃走中で近所の友達とよくやってた(笑)自首は嫌いだなぁ(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qディズニーランドのシンデレラ城に住んでみる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aちょっとの間だけなら！あとは普通の暮らしがいいな(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q早くまあやに会いたくて仕方ないんだけどどうすればいい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A私と同じ病気だ！私皆に会いたいよ〜＼(+×+)／解決法がわかんない(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q元気にしてますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aしておるぞ！今あしゅかと渋谷行ってきたの♪楽しかったよ(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q今度名前教えるね？あっもぅしってるか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aうん！知ってる(笑)手紙やCDありがとぉ(照)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q肌の色に関してはやはりモヤシこうか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aうーん！だといいが(笑)コメントに白く盛ってるとかかれた(涙)私の携帯は文字とスタンプしか合成できんのよぉ(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/7283872/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"文字数が限界を迎えるみたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/7283872/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ答えれてないからまって下さいSorry"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/7283872/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次週"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/7283872/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとやってなかったメンバー紹介だっちゃっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/7283872/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次回もよろしく"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/7283872/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Bye"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/7283872/0012.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}